          {
            title: 'Chouine',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Chouine is a traditional French trick-taking card game played mainly in and around the Loire Valley. It is primarily a two-player game, though adaptations for 3 or 4 players exist. The game combines trick-taking with declarations of combinations (marianna) that determine trumps and score bonus points. An annual Chouine World Championship is held in Lavardin.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Country/Region of Origin: Loire Valley, France\nTime Period: Origins said to date from 16th century, though modern form developed later\nHistorical Development: The game has enjoyed a revival in recent years, with formalized rules and organized play. Annual World Championship now held.\nCultural Significance: Traditional game of the Loire Valley region, now experiencing renewed interest.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Minimum Players: 2\nMaximum Players: 4\nOptimal Players: 2\nPartnerships: No (individual play)',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Type: French-suited 32-card pack\nNumber of Decks: 1\nJokers: Not included\nCards: Ace, 10, King, Queen, Jack, 9, 8, 7 in each suit\nCard Values: Ace=11, 10=10, King=4, Queen=3, Jack=2, 9/8/7=0',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '32-card French deck\nScore sheet\nTable space',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Cards per Player: Varies (5 cards each in basic game)\nTalon: Remaining cards form stock\nDealing Pattern: Alternating cards\nFirst Dealer: Determined by drawing cards - lower rank deals',
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
